  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Opt 402.07 Audit of Continuing Education. The board shall audit the documentation of continuing education of any licensee if necessary to verify the accuracy of the reported compliance.\n\nSource. #6185, eff 2-16-96; ss by #7670, eff 4-4-02, EXPIRED: 4-4-10\n\nNew. #9756, eff 7-20-10; ss by #12383, eff 9-16-17",
